# Platform: mobilesite
# Imported from Testsigma: PRP Sanity (Ball Bearing) (test case 781, run 115613, last result SUCCESS)
# Tags: regression
# OFF steps: every step that would send a REAL lead / enquiry / OTP is switched off,
#   plus the checks that only pass after it. Switch them on only when a lead is wanted.

# OFF: call Live_Touch_Chrome_Navigate_to_Homepage_setup_Popup
open https://www.justdial.com/jdmart/Mumbai/Ball-Bearing/jdm-1006849-ent-2-5519629?fl=undefined&ismap=undefined&subpage=&searchCase=&term=ball%2520beari&searchLocUpdate=0&newSearch=1&stype=category_list&srcterm=Ball%20Bearing
wait for page to load
call PS_Touch_Consent_Popup
store text of ps_touch_b2b_prp_searchbox_city as PRP_SearchBox_City
store text of ps_touch_b2b_city_filter as PRP_City_Filter
verify stored PRP_City_Filter equals "${PRP_SearchBox_City}"
verify element ps_touch_b2b_prp_sller_type_filter is visible
click ps_touch_b2b_prp_sller_type_filter
wait until element ps_touch_b2b_prp_business_filter_wholesalers is visible
verify element ps_touch_b2b_prp_business_filter_wholesalers is visible
click ps_touch_b2b_prp_business_filter_wholesalers
wait for page to load
store page url as current_url
verify stored current_url contains "Wholesalers"
verify element ps_touch_b2b_prp_brand_filter is visible
click ps_touch_b2b_prp_brand_filter
wait until element ps_touch_b2b_prp_brand_filter_skf is visible
click ps_touch_b2b_prp_brand_filter_skf
wait for page to load
store text of ps_touch_b2b_prp_brand_filter_skf as Selected_Brand_Filter_SKF
store text of ps_touch_b2b_prp_1st_product as PRP_1st_Product
verify element ps_touch_b2b_prp_brand_filter_by_id contains "SKF"
verify stored PRP_1st_Product contains "${Selected_Brand_Filter_SKF}"
# OFF: call SG_PRP_BD7_Banner_Non_Login
scroll to ps_touch_prp_10th_result
verify element ps_touch_prp_10th_result is visible
scroll to prp_9th_result_touch
verify element prp_9th_result_touch is visible
wait 2 seconds
call SG_PRP_GVS_Popup
swipe bottom to top until element b2b_prp_watch_related_videos_heading is visible, max 15 times, wait 1
call SG_PRP_Watch_Related_Video
# OFF: call RFQ_Non_Login_Flow_to_Login_and_Continue_Search
